WEBVTT

00:12:57.397 --> 00:13:00.359
We grieve for strangers
who are oceans away.

00:13:01.276 --> 00:13:04.613
In the expectation of what reward

00:13:04.613 --> 00:13:07.866
are Polish mothers leaving their strollers

00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:09.284
on train stations

00:13:09.326 --> 00:13:12.079
so Ukrainian mothers fleeing,

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.374
dispossessed and broken,
will find some respite?

00:13:17.251 --> 00:13:19.962
Yes, we are driven by incentives.

00:13:20.921 --> 00:13:24.716
But we are also driven by love,

00:13:24.758 --> 00:13:28.929
mercy, kindness, justice, solidarity.

00:13:29.721 --> 00:13:31.306
Folks,